# Project 1 - Sauce Demo Manual Testing

## Application under test
Sauce Demo (https://www.saucedemo.com) is a demo e-commerce web app. Test accounts share the password `secret_sauce`: standard_user, locked_out_user, problem_user, performance_glitch_user, error_user, visual_user.

## Application map

| Area | URL | Key functions |
|---|---|---|
| Login | / | Username, password, Login button, error banner |
| Products | /inventory.html | 6 products, sort (A-Z, Z-A, price low-high, high-low), add/remove |
| Product detail | /inventory-item.html?id=N | Name, description, price, add/remove, Back to products |
| Cart | /cart.html | Items, quantity, Remove, Continue Shopping, Checkout |
| Checkout: Your Information | /checkout-step-one.html | First Name, Last Name, Zip/Postal Code, Cancel, Continue |
| Checkout: Overview | /checkout-step-two.html | Items, payment and shipping info, item total, tax, total, Finish |
| Checkout: Complete | /checkout-complete.html | "Thank you for your order!", Back Home |
| Menu | all pages after login | All Items, About, Logout, Reset App State |

## Scope for this project
Login, product catalog, sorting, product detail, cart, checkout, logout, session handling, basic accessibility and responsive checks.

